<title>HONG KONG: Prime Success interim net HK$50.66 mln.</title>
<headline>Prime Success interim net HK$50.66 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	 9.54</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)  1.5</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	nil</p>
<p>    Net			  50.66</p>
<p>    Turnover		   488.03</p>
<p>    Company name	     Prime Success International Group Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		October 29 to November 1</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	 November 8</p>
